name text
using resource func0
*FILETYPE logic
comment print variable pth0
comment General Set and Get test
general set variable a to 10
print text Value Of Variable 'a' after being Set:
print variable a

comment You can also set it to the value of a variable
print text .
print text Value of Variable 'b' after being Set To
print text the Value of Variable 'a' :
general set variable b to !a!
print variable b

comment and use algebraic
print text .
print text Value of var c:
algebraic set variable c to a + b * 2 / a
print variable c

comment Setting a logical var
print text .
print text Logical vars d,e,f
logical set variable d to true
logical set variable e to true
logical set variable f to false
print text .
logical compare with output g as the and of !d! !e!
logical compare with output h as the or of !f! !g!
logical compare with output i as the not of !h!
print variable d
print variable e
print variable f
print text .
print text And Of d And e
print variable g
print text .
print text Or Of f And g
print variable h
print text .
print text Not Of Previous Result (h)
print variable i
print text .
general set variable a to 15
if variable !a! is greater than variable !b! then algebraic set variable z to a + b
print variable z

